{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failed Game Developer is a game of redemption. Use your instincts and tactic to get your life back on track to see unlimited wealth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After failing your dream of becoming a Game Developer, dumpster dive from the open world to create a life you had previously. Pick up work along the way as you gain experience. Recover from your embarrassing short comings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >KEY FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Open world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dumpster diving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Buy and sell items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Find jobs, careers and other sources of income in the world around you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Socialize in the town tavern</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Lease a house or buy land and build your own house</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Buy a car to get around the world faster</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Customize your character with lots of different clothing and accessory options</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3910740?t=1760480560","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3910740?t=1760480560","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910740/a23593b8d9e31cb47d75d65db186ce16f8bc5c7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760480560","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910740/a23593b8d9e31cb47d75d65db186ce16f8bc5c7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760480560","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fa